      "cooked": "<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/7/0/70bb6c673bd2023ad7dfd70ab1903255384829a5.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/70bb6c673bd2023ad7dfd70ab1903255384829a5\" title=\"Screenshot 2025-08-17 at 6.15.49 AM\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/7/0/70bb6c673bd2023ad7dfd70ab1903255384829a5_2_690x144.png\" alt=\"Screenshot 2025-08-17 at 6.15.49 AM\" data-base62-sha1=\"g5h1PHQFs1FlY4LBYJCVvzGeyxf\" width=\"690\" height=\"144\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/7/0/70bb6c673bd2023ad7dfd70ab1903255384829a5_2_690x144.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/7/0/70bb6c673bd2023ad7dfd70ab1903255384829a5_2_1035x216.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/7/0/70bb6c673bd2023ad7dfd70ab1903255384829a5_2_1380x288.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"FAFAFA\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">Screenshot 2025-08-17 at 6.15.49 AM</span><span class=\"informations\">2726×570 26.5 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>I’ve 2 items in the master, 1st one with 28% TAX and 2nd item with 18% TAX. In quotation, once I enter the articles, sales tax and charges field shows only 18% tax calculated (9% cgst &amp; 9% sgst) and doesn’t show 12% calculation.</p>\n<p>How to configure the taxes so that it shows all the tax components.</p>\n<p>Please guide.</p>",
